{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-10_end","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-10","title":"잔류","storyCode":"1-10","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"6f6a9580a4fb2209b2d6bf6314c486d960a62a8b78a3335d39f65a65f703c9b4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十一关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_11_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온의 포위망을 돌파했다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"하지만… 놈들은…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…나… 는… 으읍…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"쉿."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"…아미야가 들어선 안 된다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야도 알고 있을 거다! 저 아이는 우리가 생각하는 것보다 훨씬 성숙해져 있다고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"…으으…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"…으응…?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"그렇다고 해도 아미야에게 알려줄 순 없어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야를 더 괴롭게 하는 건 현명한 선택이 아니다. 아미야는 이미…너무 많은 것을 짊어지고 있다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"동료들의 노력을… 헛되게 할 수는 없어!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"다른 동료들이 목숨을 바쳐 우리를 구해준 이상, 우리는 박사와 아미야를… 무슨 일이 있더라도 안전한 곳까지 데려가야 한다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"맞는 말이군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"아직 침울해하고 있을 때가 아니야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"기사라면, 어떤 일이 있더라도 사람들을 인도하는 빛이 되어야 하지 않나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"…난 잘 모르겠다. 하지만 내가 할 일은 해야겠지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"니어","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"대열을 갖춰라! 신속하게 움직여! 곧 도착이다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"훗…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"생각해보니… 나한테 안심하라고 했던 놈들은, 이제까지 누구 하나 돌아오지 못했군."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname} 박사님…? 무슨 일이… 있었던 건가요…?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"저, 저 좀… 내려주세요…"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"네, 괜찮아요. 혼자 걸을 수 있어요…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"잠시… 의식을 잃었을 뿐이에요… 이제 괜찮아요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…탈출에 성공한 거죠?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"에이스 씨와 다른 분들은…"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"그렇게 되었군요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"괜찮아요. 에이스 씨라면 문제없을 겁니다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드 분들은 모두 강하니까요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"이제 곧 남쪽 출구네요. 체르노보그에서 탈출만 하면 우리는……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"우리는…… 그걸로……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"박사님…… 잠시…… 기대도 괜찮을까요……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"잠시…… 아주 잠시만이라도 좋으니까……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"탈룰라","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"탈룰라","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"성가신 녀석이군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"이렇게까지… 싸울 수 있을 줄이야… 이 녀석…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"거리의 절반이 숯덩어리가 되고, 광장은 불바다에… 강철도 다 녹아 흘러내렸건만…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"그런데 어떻게…… 이 녀석은 아직 싸울 수 있는 거지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"뼈가 가루가 될 때까지 싸울 생각인가…… 훌륭하군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"탈룰라","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"기억해 두도록 하지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"탈룰라","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"…로도스 아일랜드."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["탈룰라"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["도베르만"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["니어","아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["???"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["메피스토"]}]}
